{"id":381,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Latios will only open its heart to a Trainer with a compassionate spirit. This Pokémon can fly faster than a jet plane by folding its forelegs to minimize air resistance."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Latios has the ability to make others see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This Pokémon is intelligent and understands human speech."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It understands human speech and is highly intelligent. It is a tender Pokémon that dislikes fighting."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"A highly intelligent Pokémon. By folding back its wings in flight, it can overtake jet planes."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It has a docile temperament and dislikes fighting. Tucking in its forelegs, it can fly faster than a jet plane."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Even in hiding, it can detect the locations of others and sense their emotions since it has telepathy. Its intelligence allows it to understand human languages."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"LATIOS has the ability to make its foe see an image of what it has seen or imagines in its head. This POKéMON is intelligent and understands human speech."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":90,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":381,"name":"Latios","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,349],[1,500],[5,270],[10,105],[15,93],[20,366],[25,225],[30,502],[35,295],[40,428],[45,406],[50,505],[55,493],[60,94],[65,471],[70,262]],"machine":[332,97,314,403,396,226,34,784,523,347,451,886,38,434,913,337,349,406,814,89,203,412,263,812,19,248,416,447,270,63,58,196,113,710,20